{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "\n\nIf the target loses power, uncommitted writes are lost out of order — which can corrupt the volume's structure, not just recent files. Choose this only if the target's cache is protected: battery-backed, on a UPS, or with its write cache disabled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\nSi el destino se queda sin alimentación, las escrituras no consolidadas se pierden en desorden, lo que puede dañar la estructura del volumen, no solo los archivos recientes. Elige esta opción solo si la caché del destino está protegida: con batería de respaldo, conectada a un UPS o con su caché de escritura desactivada."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n如果目标设备断电，未提交的写入可能无序丢失，既可能丢失新文件，也可能破坏整个卷的结构。仅当目标缓存具备电池或 UPS 保护，或已关闭写入缓存时，才应选择此设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " (the full LaunchServices scan is still running)": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " (el análisis completo de LaunchServices sigue en curso)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（LaunchServices 的完整扫描仍在进行）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Attached now: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " Conectados ahora: %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 当前连接：%1$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "!": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%@\n\nForce Eject takes the volume away from whatever is using it. Anything those apps have not saved is lost, and a file being written at that moment can be left incomplete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@\n\nForzar expulsión le quita el volumen a lo que lo esté usando. Se pierde todo lo que esas apps no hayan guardado, y un archivo que se esté escribiendo en ese momento puede quedar incompleto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@\n\n强制推出会立即断开正在使用此卷的应用。尚未保存的内容会丢失，正在写入的文件也可能不完整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ %llu": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%@ (fell back from %@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ (en lugar de %@)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@（原接口 %2$@ 不可用，已切换）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ already exists and is not a link, so it is left alone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ ya existe y no es un enlace, así que no se toca."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 已存在且不是符号链接，已保留原文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ already links to %@, so it is left alone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ ya enlaza a %@, así que no se toca."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 已链接到 %2$@，已保留原链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ could not be removed": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "no se pudo eliminar %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法移除 %1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ did not finish within 20 s": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ no terminó en 20 s"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 在 20 秒内未完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ exited %d": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ terminó con el código %d"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 已退出，状态码为 %2$d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ failed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ falló: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 失败：%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is not this app's, and was left alone": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ no es de esta app, y no se tocó"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 不属于此应用，已保留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ links to this app": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ enlaza a esta app"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 已链接到此应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ — macOS's list of extensions leaves it out, but FSKit loads it (checked with a local test mount)": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ — la lista de extensiones de macOS no la incluye, pero FSKit la carga (verificado con un montaje de prueba local)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 未出现在 macOS 的扩展列表中，但本机测试确认 FSKit 可以加载它"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. To remove it yourself: sudo rm %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@. Para quitarlo tú mismo: sudo rm %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@。如需手动移除，请执行：sudo rm %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld GB": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld GB"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld GB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld bytes": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld bytes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 字节"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld other copies are registered: %@. macOS can run the background service from any of them instead of this one; if one is on a disk image, the image can't be ejected and attaching stops working once it is gone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另有 %1$lld 个应用副本已注册：%2$@。macOS 可能从其中任一副本运行后台服务，而不是当前副本。如果某个副本位于磁盘映像中，将无法推出该映像；副本消失后，磁盘挂载功能将无法使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "(not resolved)": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "(sin resolver)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（尚未解析）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Nothing on the storage device itself is changed.** Your data stays where it is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**No se cambia nada en el propio dispositivo de almacenamiento.** Tus datos se quedan donde están."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**不会更改存储设备上的任何内容。** 你的数据会保留在原处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A disk request did not match the device's block layout.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una solicitud de disco no coincidía con la estructura de bloques del dispositivo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "磁盘请求与设备的块布局不匹配。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few permissions are still needed": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún faltan algunos permisos"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还需要授予几项权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A virtual machine or another app has %@ open. Shut it down first, then detach.\n\nForce Eject takes the disk away from it. A guest system loses whatever it has not written yet, and its filesystem can be left damaged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una máquina virtual u otra app tiene %@ abierto. Apágala primero y luego desconecta.\n\nForzar expulsión le quita el disco. El sistema invitado pierde todo lo que aún no haya escrito, y su sistema de archivos puede quedar dañado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "某个虚拟机或其他应用正在使用 %1$@。请先将其关闭，再断开。\n\n强制推出会直接从它手中拿走磁盘。客户机系统会丢失尚未写入的数据，其文件系统也可能损坏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accept the Risk": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aceptar el riesgo"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接受风险"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Access": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Acceso"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "访问权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agregar"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add %@ Target": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agregar destino %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加 %1$@ 目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Link": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agregar enlace"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加命令行链接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add an %@ target": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agregar un destino %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加 %1$@ 目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add as a Raw Device": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agregar como dispositivo sin procesar"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "作为原始设备添加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add it to the subsystem's allowed hosts on the storage device, or allow any host there. Namespace IDs start at 1.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agrégalo a los hosts permitidos del subsistema en el dispositivo de almacenamiento, o permite allí cualquier host. Los ID de espacio de nombres empiezan en 1."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在存储设备上，将此标识加入子系统的允许主机列表，或允许任意主机连接。命名空间 ID 从 1 开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add it to the target's allowed initiators on the storage device, or allow any initiator there. It follows this Mac's name, so renaming the Mac changes it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agrégalo a los iniciadores permitidos del destino en el dispositivo de almacenamiento, o permite allí cualquier iniciador. Depende del nombre de esta Mac, así que cambia si renombras la Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在存储设备上，将此标识加入目标的允许发起端列表，或允许任意发起端连接。此标识随 Mac 名称生成，更改 Mac 名称后也会改变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add mounts its volumes in Finder. Add as a Raw Device leaves the disk unmounted, as /dev/rdiskN, for a virtual machine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agregar monta sus volúmenes en el Finder. Agregar como dispositivo sin procesar deja el disco sin montar, como /dev/rdiskN, para una máquina virtual."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“添加”会在 Finder 中挂载其卷。“作为原始设备添加”不挂载磁盘，只以 /dev/rdiskN 的形式提供给虚拟机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Added": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agregado"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已添加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dirección"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All installed modules": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todos los módulos instalados"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有已安装模块"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An NVMe/TCP subsystem name starts with “nqn.”. For an iSCSI target, add one under iSCSI.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El nombre de un subsistema NVMe/TCP empieza por “nqn.”. Para un destino iSCSI, agrégalo en iSCSI."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NVMe/TCP 子系统名称须以“nqn.”开头。如需添加 iSCSI 目标，请在 iSCSI 分组中添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another account on this Mac has this disk attached.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Otra cuenta de esta Mac tiene este disco conectado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Mac 上的另一个账户已挂载此磁盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another copy is registered at %@. macOS can run the background service from it instead of this one; if it is on a disk image, the image can't be ejected and attaching stops working once it is gone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一个应用副本已在 %1$@ 注册。macOS 可能从该副本运行后台服务，而不是当前副本。如果它位于磁盘映像中，将无法推出该映像；副本消失后，磁盘挂载功能将无法使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask the target which %@ it has.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pregunta al destino qué %@ tiene."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查询目标提供的%1$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asking the target…": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Consultando al destino…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在查询目标…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conectar"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "挂载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach a target to open a session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conecta un destino para abrir una sesión."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "挂载一个存储目标即可建立连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach as a raw device": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conectar como dispositivo sin procesar"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以原始设备挂载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach at login": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conectar al iniciar sesión"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时自动挂载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach at login is turned off in System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conectar al iniciar sesión está desactivado en Configuración del Sistema."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统设置中已关闭登录时自动挂载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach at login needs the app in /Applications.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conectar al iniciar sesión requiere la app en /Applications."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时自动挂载需要将应用放在 /Applications 中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attached as": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conectado como"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "挂载方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attached under a target's earlier address, name or LUN, or for a target that has since been removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conectados con la dirección, el nombre o el LUN que un destino tenía antes, o de un destino que ya se eliminó."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些磁盘使用目标编辑前的地址、名称或 LUN 挂载，或其对应目标已被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attaches by itself when you log in to this Mac. If the target can't be reached, keeps trying for 5 minutes, then shows a warning here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se conecta solo cuando inicias sesión en esta Mac. Si no se puede acceder al destino, lo sigue intentando durante 5 minutos y luego muestra un aviso aquí."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录此 Mac 时自动挂载。若目标无法访问，会持续重试 5 分钟，之后在此处显示提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attaching it from two accounts at once would corrupt it. Detach it in that account first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conectarlo desde dos cuentas a la vez lo dañaría. Desconéctalo primero en esa cuenta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两个账户同时挂载此磁盘会导致数据损坏。请先在另一个账户中断开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attaching it from two accounts at once would corrupt it. Eject it in the other account, then attach it here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conectarlo desde dos cuentas a la vez lo dañaría. Expúlsalo en la otra cuenta y luego conéctalo aquí."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两个账户同时挂载此磁盘会导致数据损坏。请先在另一个账户中推出，再在此处挂载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attaching storage at login": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conectando almacenamiento al iniciar sesión"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时正在挂载存储设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attaching “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se pudo conectar “%@”"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在挂载“%1$@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attempt enablement write": {
