            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26.x 兼容方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS has not registered the extension inside this app yet. This usually resolves itself a moment after the app is moved or launched; if it does not, registering explicitly fixes it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS aún no ha registrado la extensión que contiene esta app. Normalmente se resuelve solo un momento después de mover o abrir la app; si no, registrarla explícitamente lo arregla."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 尚未注册此应用内的扩展。移动或启动应用后通常稍等即可；若仍未完成，可点击“注册”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS is waiting for you to allow the background service in System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS está esperando a que permitas el servicio en segundo plano en Configuración del Sistema."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在系统设置中允许此后台服务运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS needs your permission to run the filesystem extension. Turn on “iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator” under File System Extensions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS necesita tu permiso para ejecutar la extensión del sistema de archivos. Activa “iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator” en Extensiones del sistema de archivos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 需要你的许可才能运行文件系统扩展。请在“文件系统扩展”中开启“iSCSI/NVMe/TCP Initiator”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS started the background service from %@ again instead of this copy. Remove or clean up that copy, then quit and reopen this app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS volvió a iniciar el servicio en segundo plano desde %@ en lugar de desde esta copia. Elimina o limpia esa copia, y luego sal de esta app y vuelve a abrirla."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 再次从 %1$@ 启动了后台服务。请移除或清理该副本，再退出并重新打开当前应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS still does not list the extension after re-registering. Quitting and reopening the app usually settles it; if not, drag the app out of Applications and back in. (tried: %@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS sigue sin mostrar la extensión tras volver a registrarla. Salir de la app y volver a abrirla suele resolverlo; si no, saca la app de Aplicaciones y vuelve a ponerla. (intentado: %@)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新注册后，macOS 仍未列出此扩展。请先退出并重新打开应用；若仍无效，将应用移出“应用程序”文件夹后再移回。（已尝试：%1$@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS still has a record of %@, which no longer exists — usually an ejected disk image. Nothing uses it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 仍保留 %1$@ 的注册记录，但该副本已不存在，通常是已推出的磁盘映像。目前没有任何服务使用它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS still has records of %lld copies that no longer exist — usually ejected disk images: %@. Nothing uses them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 仍保留 %1$lld 个已不存在副本的注册记录，通常是已推出的磁盘映像：%2$@。目前没有任何服务使用这些副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS's list of extensions leaves it out, and a local test mount failed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "la lista de extensiones de macOS no la incluye, y falló un montaje de prueba local: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 的扩展列表中没有此模块，本机测试挂载也失败了：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "namespace": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "espacio de nombres"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命名空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "namespaces": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "espacios de nombres"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命名空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "nas.local": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "no enabledModules.plist at that path — refusing to invent one, since writing a fresh file would drop Apple's own modules from the enabled set": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "no hay ningún enabledModules.plist en esa ruta — no se crea uno, porque escribir un archivo nuevo quitaría los módulos de Apple del conjunto activado"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定位置没有 enabledModules.plist。为避免遗漏 Apple 的系统模块，不会新建此文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "not installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "no instalado"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "not registered — FSKit does not know this module exists": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "no registrado — FSKit no sabe que este módulo existe"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未注册：FSKit 尚未识别此模块"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "not removed": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "no se quitó"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未移除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "not run": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "no se ejecutó"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未执行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "nothing else is removed while a volume is in use.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "no se elimina nada más mientras un volumen esté en uso."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卷仍在使用中，已停止后续移除操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "nothing left behind": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "no quedó nada"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未留下其他文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "nothing was attached": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "no había nada conectado"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有已挂载的卷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "nqn.2011-06.com.truenas:uuid:…:disk0": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "only this copy is registered": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "solo esta copia está registrada"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅当前副本已注册"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "optional": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "opcional"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选填"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "query failed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "falló la consulta: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查询失败：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "raw device %@ — nothing mounted": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "dispositivo sin procesar %@ — nada montado"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原始设备 %1$@ — 未挂载任何卷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "read failed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "falló la lectura: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取失败：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "recovered %lld×": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "recuperada %lld×"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已恢复连接 %1$lld 次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "registered and ENABLED": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "registrado y ACTIVADO"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已注册并启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "registered, DISABLED — this is the gate": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "registrado, DESACTIVADO — este es el bloqueo"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已注册但未启用，需要先允许此扩展运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "removed": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "eliminado"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已移除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "removed %lld duplicate registration(s)": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "se eliminaron %lld registro(s) duplicado(s)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已移除 %1$lld 条重复注册信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "removed; %lld other accounts' saved targets were kept": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "eliminado; se conservaron los destinos guardados de otras %lld cuentas"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已移除，已保留其他 %1$lld 个账户保存的目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "removed; another account's saved targets were kept": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "eliminado; se conservaron los destinos guardados de otra cuenta"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已移除，已保留另一个账户保存的目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "running %@ (%@), pid %d": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "versión %@ (%@) en ejecución, pid %d"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在运行 %1$@（构建 %2$@），进程 ID：%3$d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "running %@ but this app is %@ — needs re-registering": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "se ejecuta la versión %@, pero esta app es la %@ — hay que volver a registrarlo"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务版本为 %1$@，应用版本为 %2$@，需要重新注册"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "running %@, pid %d": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "versión %@ en ejecución, pid %d"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在运行 %1$@，进程 ID：%2$d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "running from %@. A LaunchDaemon has to be reachable before anyone logs in, and it runs as root from wherever this app lives — so the app needs to be in /Applications, which only an administrator can change, rather than in your home folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "se está ejecutando desde %@. Un LaunchDaemon tiene que estar accesible antes de que alguien inicie sesión, y se ejecuta como root desde donde esté esta app, así que la app debe estar en /Applications, que solo un administrador puede modificar, y no en tu carpeta de inicio."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前运行位置为 %1$@。后台服务需要在用户登录前可用，并以 root 权限运行，因此应用应放在仅管理员可修改的 /Applications 中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "running from a temporary read-only copy (App Translocation). Move it to Applications and reopen — a daemon registered from here would point at a path that disappears.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "se está ejecutando desde una copia temporal de solo lectura (App Translocation). Muévela a Aplicaciones y vuelve a abrirla: un daemon registrado desde aquí apuntaría a una ruta que desaparece."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前正从临时只读副本运行（App Translocation）。请移至“应用程序”后重新打开，否则后台服务将指向可能消失的路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "running from another copy of the app at %@ — needs reinstalling from this one": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "se ejecuta desde otra copia de la app en %@ — hay que reinstalarlo desde esta"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务正在从另一个应用副本 %1$@ 运行，需要从当前副本重新安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "still attached: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "aún conectado: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仍有连接：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "still in use: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "aún en uso: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仍在使用：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the LaunchDaemon plist is missing from the app bundle (packaging bug)": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "falta el plist del LaunchDaemon en el paquete de la app (error de empaquetado)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用包缺少 LaunchDaemon 配置文件，请重新安装完整应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the app's code signature is not valid for this. Reinstall by dragging from the DMG.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "la firma de código de la app no es válida para esto. Reinstálala arrastrándola desde el DMG."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用的代码签名无效，无法执行此操作。请从磁盘映像重新安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the background service belongs to another copy of the app at %@; it needs reinstalling from this one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "el servicio en segundo plano pertenece a otra copia de la app en %@; hay que reinstalarlo desde esta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务属于另一个应用副本 %1$@，需要从当前副本重新安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the background service is approved but not running — most often because it belongs to a copy of the app that no longer exists. Reinstall it from this copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "el servicio en segundo plano está aprobado pero no se está ejecutando; lo más habitual es que pertenezca a una copia de la app que ya no existe. Reinstálalo desde esta copia."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务已获批准但未运行，通常是因为它指向的应用副本已不存在。请从当前副本重新安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the background service is kept until it has deleted the saved passwords. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "el servicio en segundo plano se conserva hasta que haya borrado las contraseñas guardadas. Intenta de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在已保存的密码删除之前，将保留后台服务。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the background service is version %@ but this app is %@; it needs reinstalling.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "el servicio en segundo plano es la versión %@, pero esta app es la %@; hay que reinstalarlo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务版本为 %1$@，当前应用版本为 %2$@，需要重新安装后台服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the daemon does not implement the protocol": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "el daemon no implementa el protocolo"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务不支持此通信协议"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the daemon is not running": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "el daemon no está en ejecución"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务未运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the daemon replied with nothing": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "el daemon no respondió nada"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务未返回任何内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the daemon sent a reply this version cannot read (%@). This usually means the app and the background service are different versions; the Setup screen can reinstall it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "el daemon envió una respuesta que esta versión no puede leer (%@). Normalmente significa que la app y el servicio en segundo plano son de versiones distintas; la pantalla Configuración inicial puede reinstalarlo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务返回了当前版本无法读取的响应（%1$@）。这通常表示应用与后台服务的版本不一致；可在“初始设置”页面重新安装后台服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the daemon stopped mid-call": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "el daemon se detuvo a mitad de la llamada"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务在请求过程中中断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the extension is not registered yet — that step has to pass first": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "la extensión aún no está registrada — ese paso tiene que completarse primero"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩展尚未注册，请先完成注册"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the system still reports it as registered (status %lld)": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "el sistema aún lo indica como registrado (estado %lld)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统仍显示服务已注册（状态 %1$lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the volume serving the LUN": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "el volumen que sirve el LUN"
